{"unit_id":"cca6097d975327a7bee2","title":"提案八","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b13","raw_text":"提案八 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[36.0,478.2060241699219,92.0040054321289,494.166015625]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b14","raw_text":"案由：安眠藥及管制藥品可否開立連續處方箋，提請討論。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":28,"bbox":[36.0,514.2060546875,460.0,530.166015625]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b15","raw_text":"說明: 1. 管制藥品管理條例所規定之第一級及第二級管制藥品，不得開給 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":37,"bbox":[36.0,550.2060546875,563.9400024414062,566.166015625]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b16","raw_text":"         慢性病連續處方箋。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":20,"bbox":[36.0,586.2060546875,260.0299987792969,602.166015625]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b17","raw_text":"      2. 對於第三級及第四級管制藥品因有濫用及成癮的疑慮，開立連續 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":39,"bbox":[36.0,622.236083984375,563.9400024414062,638.196044921875]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b18","raw_text":"         處方宜謹慎，若確實有必要，應詳實載明理由。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":32,"bbox":[36.0,658.236083984375,451.96002197265625,674.196044921875]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b19","raw_text":"決議：通過，同說明段。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":13,"bbox":[36.0,694.236083984375,219.9499969482422,710.196044921875]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-4b62b045cdb5927d8902-p4-b20","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.0,730.2320556640625,43.97999954223633,746.1920166015625]}],"source_quality":[]}